{
  "_comment": [
    "The frames the gateway puts on the GT86 / ADU bus and the signals in them. tools/generate.py turns this,",
    "plus ToyotaLens's data/{engine,ect,abs}.json, into src/uds/uds_definitions.cpp, src/translator_table.cpp",
    "and gateway.dbc. Edit this file, run the generator, never edit the generated files.",
    "",
    "Every signal is little-endian; startBit is the bit position of its least significant bit (byte*8 + bit).",
    "A signal without 'factor' is pass-through: the ECU's raw value goes into the frame unchanged, its width",
    "comes from the ToyotaLens mask, and the DBC carries ToyotaLens's scale factor and offset. A signal with",
    "'factor' (and 'bits') is re-encoded: raw = (physical - offset) / factor, the way the GT86 modules expect.",
    "'blockByte' copies one byte of a Mode 21 block into one frame byte, every flag keeping its bit position.",
    "",
    "GT86 packets: ids, default bytes and the layouts below were taken from captures of the real GT86 bus in",
    "gt86-isf-swap/logs/GT86 (cluster_working_no_errors.txt for the bytes; the two-minute drive for the",
    "layouts: 0xD1 and 0xD4 at 0.0565 km/h per bit, 0x141 bits 32-45 engine rpm, 0x360 bytes 2-3 oil and",
    "coolant temperature minus 40). Intervals are the rates seen in the drive capture.",
    "",
    "ADU frames: 0x5E0-0x5E7, the only band empty on the GT86 bus (its traffic spans 0x018-0x4DD, 0x63B,",
    "0x6E1-0x6E2 and the 0x7xx diagnostic ids)."
  ],
  "toyotaLensData": "../../ToyotaLens/data",
  "frames": [
    {
      "id": "0xD0", "name": "GT86_GSensor", "gt86": true, "interval": 100,
      "defaults": "8B FB 25 00 01 08 04 01",
      "comment": "Steering angle and lateral/longitudinal G; default bytes only",
      "signals": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0xD1", "name": "GT86_VehicleSpeed", "gt86": true, "interval": 100,
      "defaults": "F0 07 00 00 B8 0F FC 08",
      "comment": "Vehicle speed (bytes 0-1, 0.0565 km/h per bit) and brake data",
      "signals": [
        {"module": "engine", "uniqueId": "cLlSvC_7u", "name": "VehicleSpeed", "startBit": 0, "bits": 16, "factor": 0.0565, "offset": 0, "unit": "km/h"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0xD2", "name": "GT86_Unknown_D2", "gt86": true, "interval": 100,
      "defaults": "00 00 FF FF 00 00 00 00",
      "signals": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0xD3", "name": "GT86_LightStatus", "gt86": true, "interval": 100,
      "defaults": "00 06 C0 0F 00 00 32 00",
      "comment": "VSC / TCS / SCS lights; default bytes only",
      "signals": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0xD4", "name": "GT86_WheelSpeeds", "gt86": true, "interval": 40,
      "defaults": "F0 07 F0 07 F0 07 F0 07",
      "comment": "Four wheel speeds, 16 bits each, 0.0565 km/h per bit",
      "signals": [
        {"module": "abs", "uniqueId": "-HYSOLbJn", "name": "WheelSpeedFL", "startBit": 0, "bits": 16, "factor": 0.0565, "offset": 0, "unit": "km/h"},
        {"module": "abs", "uniqueId": "v4xnACb-1", "name": "WheelSpeedFR", "startBit": 16, "bits": 16, "factor": 0.0565, "offset": 0, "unit": "km/h"},
        {"module": "abs", "uniqueId": "AcK0rmPvM", "name": "WheelSpeedRL", "startBit": 32, "bits": 16, "factor": 0.0565, "offset": 0, "unit": "km/h"},
        {"module": "abs", "uniqueId": "t1FnfghgK", "name": "WheelSpeedRR", "startBit": 48, "bits": 16, "factor": 0.0565, "offset": 0, "unit": "km/h"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0x140", "name": "GT86_EngineData1", "gt86": true, "interval": 50,
      "defaults": "00 05 00 43 00 00 00 01",
      "comment": "Default bytes only: bytes 2-3 did not move with engine speed in the drive capture",
      "signals": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0x141", "name": "GT86_EngineData2", "gt86": true, "interval": 50,
      "defaults": "00 00 00 00 00 83 A7 00",
      "comment": "Engine rpm in bits 32-45 (bytes 4-5, 14 bits, 1 rpm per bit); bits 46-47 kept from the default",
